=== SUMMARY ===
Unit tests (AnomalyDetectorWidgetTest, testReleaseUnitTest): 23 tests, 0 failures, 0 errors, 0 skipped.
Instrumented (AnomalyDetectorWidgetUiTest): 10 @Test cases, compiled clean (run on device under A9-0002).
States reproduced: loading, content, empty ("No anomalies"), error (QueryError + retry), stale (chip),
  offline (cached + chip). Compact (cols<=1) count tile + Badge; full tip-card list otherwise.
Data binding: shared S8 AnomaliesStore + VehiclesStore via collectAsStateWithLifecycle + Resource.toUiState
  (cache-then-network ADR-013). No direct HTTP from the view. vid = vehicleId ?? vehicles[0].id;
  feed disabled until a vehicle resolves (web `enabled: vehicleId !== null`).
Registry: id=anomaly-detector category=analytics default=2x4 min=1x2 max=4x40 (clamp + isCompact enforced).
Telemetry: TelemetryEvent.ScreenView(screen="AnomalyDetectorWidget", platform="android", appVersion) on open.
Accessibility: per-row + compact-tile contentDescription builders; Icon/IconButton carry descriptions.

